The tree-sitter grammar (grammar.js and the parser generated from it), the Lezer
grammar (tptp.grammar and the parser generated from it), the Monarch tokenizer
(monarch.ts) and the highlighting rules are generated from the TPTP syntax BNF,
https://github.com/TPTPWorld/SyntaxBNF, by `mix lang_tptp.gen`
(https://github.com/jcschuster/lang-tptp). The BNF is read from the copy that the
`tptp` Hex package vendors; each package records the BNF version it was generated
from under "tptp": {"bnf": ...} in its package.json.

